/-!
# Finite atomic one-dimensional Wasserstein distance

This roll-up module provides finite atomic probability laws on the real line, the finite
transport-polytope definition of their one-Wasserstein distance, the CDF cost formula, and exact
Kantorovich--Rubinstein duality attained by a one-Lipschitz potential.
-/

import Causalean.Stat.Coupling.FiniteAtomicWasserstein.Basic
import Causalean.Stat.Coupling.FiniteAtomicWasserstein.Transport
import Causalean.Stat.Coupling.FiniteAtomicWasserstein.Duality
